[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697934936","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103466#issuecomment-2697934936","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103466","id":2697934936,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gzzhY","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T14:58:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T14:58:35Z","body":"The bug originates from merge #101842 .\nPressing space key belongs to \"ui_accept\" action and \"ui_select\" action.\nBefore #101842, the tree control code processed \"ui_accept\" action first, then \"ui_select\" action. So Pressing space key would go into the if statement dealing with \"ui_accept\" action, and started rename.\n#101842 exchanged \"ui_accept\" action and \"ui_select\" action. So Pressing space key will go into the if statement dealing with \"ui_select\" action, and never start rename.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697934936/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705614431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103466#issuecomment-2705614431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103466","id":2705614431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hRGZf","user":{"login":"Tiny-can-WZB","id":32259492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU5NDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32259492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB","html_url":"https://github.com/Tiny-can-WZB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tiny-can-WZB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T06:10:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T06:10:55Z","body":"> The bug originates from merge [#101842](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101842) . Pressing space key belongs to \"ui_accept\" action and \"ui_select\" action. Before [#101842](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101842), the tree control code processed \"ui_accept\" action first, then \"ui_select\" action. So Pressing space key would go into the if statement dealing with \"ui_accept\" action, and started rename. [#101842](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101842) exchanged \"ui_accept\" action and \"ui_select\" action. So Pressing space key will go into the if statement dealing with \"ui_select\" action, and never start rename.\n\nSo its intended to work this way?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705614431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731011783","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103466#issuecomment-2731011783","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103466","id":2731011783,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ix-7H","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T21:48:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T21:48:36Z","body":"CC @havi05 @KoBeWi \n\nIt seems indeed like it's intentional, but I see how it can be an issue for people used to this workflow.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731011783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731053053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103466#issuecomment-2731053053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103466","id":2731053053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iyI_9","user":{"login":"havi05","id":71942164,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTQyMTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71942164?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05","html_url":"https://github.com/havi05","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/havi05/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T22:13:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T22:13:47Z","body":"Currently, I don't have an idea how to support both actions using the same key. \n\nI changed the order of if statements, because previously it wasn't possible to select an item in a tree by pressing a key, but ui_accept has another key mapped (Enter) so at least there would be a way to trigger both actions with the default key mapping.\n\nAs a quick workaround, you could change the default key mapping for ui_select in the editor settings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731053053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733491298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103466#issuecomment-2733491298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103466","id":2733491298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i7cRi","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T14:37:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T14:37:18Z","body":"As I mentioned in the PR, it fixed an issue for default control scheme (previously you couldn't use `ui_select` because of overlap). Alternative was remapping either action to a different key, but it's less invasive to change behavior of one node than all of them.\n\nYou can still rename nodes with Enter, or as mentioned above, change `ui_select` to something else. Unless there is a solution that would solve both issues, having correct behavior with default scheme takes priority, so it's not going to be changed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733491298/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383353399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103466#issuecomment-3383353399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103466","id":3383353399,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JqeA3","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T21:48:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T21:48:56Z","body":"I honestly think this can be closed, since <kbd>Enter</kbd> does the same thing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383353399/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,